---
config:
  theme: default
title: User Authentication Sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant AuthService
    participant Backend
    participant MongoDB
    participant JWT
    
    %% Registration Flow
    Note over User,JWT: Registration Flow
    User->>Browser: Navigate to /register
    Browser->>User: Display Registration Form
    User->>Browser: Enter name, email, password
    Browser->>Backend: POST /api/auth/register
    Backend->>MongoDB: Check if email exists
    MongoDB-->>Backend: Email not found
    Backend->>Backend: Hash password with bcrypt
    Backend->>MongoDB: Create new user document
    MongoDB-->>Backend: User created successfully
    Backend->>JWT: Generate token with user._id
    JWT-->>Backend: Return JWT token
    Backend-->>Browser: 201 Created + {token, user}
    Browser->>AuthService: Store token in localStorage
    Browser->>Browser: Update Zustand authStore
    Browser->>User: Redirect to /dashboard
    
    %% Login Flow
    Note over User,JWT: Login Flow
    User->>Browser: Navigate to /login
    Browser->>User: Display Login Form
    User->>Browser: Enter email & password
    Browser->>Backend: POST /api/auth/login
    Backend->>MongoDB: Find user by email
    MongoDB-->>Backend: Return user document
    Backend->>Backend: Compare password with bcrypt
    alt Password valid
        Backend->>JWT: Generate token with user._id
        JWT-->>Backend: Return JWT token
        Backend-->>Browser: 200 OK + {token, user}
        Browser->>AuthService: Store token in localStorage
        Browser->>Browser: Update Zustand authStore
        Browser->>User: Redirect to /dashboard
    else Password invalid
        Backend-->>Browser: 401 Unauthorized
        Browser->>User: Display error message
    end
    
    %% Protected Route Access
    Note over User,JWT: Protected Route Access
    User->>Browser: Navigate to /api/jobs
    Browser->>Backend: GET /api/jobs<br/>Header: Authorization Bearer token
    Backend->>JWT: Verify token
    alt Token valid
        JWT-->>Backend: Decoded payload with user._id
        Backend->>MongoDB: Fetch jobs with user context
        MongoDB-->>Backend: Return jobs
        Backend-->>Browser: 200 OK + jobs data
        Browser->>User: Display jobs
    else Token invalid/expired
        JWT-->>Backend: Token verification failed
        Backend-->>Browser: 401 Unauthorized
        Browser->>AuthService: Clear token from localStorage
        Browser->>User: Redirect to /login
    end
